sequenceDiagram
  actor Seller as Seller UI
  actor Buyer as Buyer UI
  participant API as FastAPI API
  participant PG as PostgreSQL

  Seller->>+API: POST /offers/{id}/accept (Idempotency-Key)
  API->>+PG: Lock product & offer, set RESERVED + PENDING_CONFIRM
  PG-->>-API: Committed Order & OrderEvent
  API-->>-Seller: 201 Order DTO

  Buyer->>+API: POST /orders/{id}/meetup (place & slots)
  API->>+PG: Lock product, order, meetup
  alt Terminal or completion confirmed
    PG-->>API: Completion flag or terminal status
    API-->>Buyer: 409 ORDER_STATE_CONFLICT
  else Order active & unconfirmed
    PG-->>-API: Increment version & reset *_confirmed_version = 0
    API-->>-Buyer: 200 Meetup DTO (v+1)
  end

  Buyer->>+API: POST /orders/{id}/meetup/confirm (id, v+1)
  API->>+PG: Verify version (409 MEETUP_VERSION_CONFLICT if stale), set buyer_confirmed_version
  PG-->>-API: Updated Meetup
  API-->>-Buyer: 200 Awaiting Seller

  Seller->>+API: POST /orders/{id}/meetup/confirm (id, v+1)
  API->>+PG: Set seller_confirmed_version, MEETUP_ARRANGED
  PG-->>-API: Committed Order state
  API-->>-Seller: 200 Order (MEETUP_ARRANGED)

  Buyer->>+API: POST /orders/{id}/confirm-complete
  API->>+PG: Verify meetupVersion, set buyer_confirmed_complete
  PG-->>-API: Partial confirmation saved
  API-->>-Buyer: 200 Order (awaiting seller)

  Seller->>+API: POST /orders/{id}/confirm-complete
  API->>+PG: Set seller_confirmed_complete, COMPLETED + SOLD
  PG-->>-API: Committed terminal trade
  API-->>-Seller: 200 Order (COMPLETED)
